    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f814da9f-dc24-5ad3-b596-f1cbc9492e0a" activityNameId="6c06e8f1-be56-5c93-9e42-313b387351e8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at ice storage heat pump, brine-water, 50kW, CH electr., in new building</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at ice storage heat pump, brine-water, 50kW, CH electr., in new building
Heat from a brine-water heat pump, 50kW with heat source form ice storage and solar tube collector plus energy input from Swiss electricity mix (CH). Lifetime of the heating system is 20 years, ice storage lifetime is 25 years. SPF=5.5. Loss of coolant is 2% (of the total amount in the system) per year. 
UUID: 42644201-a724-3b5a-a71d-3ba6ef9f47aa
Included are the share of the production of the brine-water heatpump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ. Also the ice storage tank and the solar tube collectors as part of the whole system with a lifetime of  25 years is part of this process. 
The use of electricity (Swiss electriciy mix) is calculated by the SPF = 5.5 for a new building, apartment house.
Also the loss of coolant (2% in a year) is included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. 
Technology: 
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_42644201-a724-3b5a-a71d-3ba6ef9f47aa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
